# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: direct damage to the opposing player.
# Forcing: the opponent has three life and the only damaging card is Lightning Bolt.
# AI behavior: the opponent has no decision before the intended win.
# Failure modes: WIN means Bolt resolved on the opponent; LOSE means the one-turn goal expired; TIMEOUT means play stopped.
# Card roles: Lightning Bolt deals exact lethal; Mountain pays for it; library lands prevent an empty draw.
# Protocol path: cast action, target player, stack resolution, terminal win.
